    <section id="guide" class="screen overlay">
      <div class="panel modal guide">
        <div class="mhead"><h2>ROADSTER JUMP</h2><button class="icon-btn sm" data-a="closemodal" aria-label="Close">${X.close}</button></div>
        <p class="tut-lead">The rocket jump that clears <b>two rows</b> of obstacles and rolls 360° in the sky.</p>
        <div class="gsteps">
          <button class="gstep" data-a="gstep"><img src="${zy}" alt="" /><b><i>1</i> Spot the purple rocket</b><small>Appears after 250 m, floating in a lane. Swipe into its lane to grab it.</small>
            <div class="gmore"><b>Details</b>The rocket pickup floats at driving height in one lane and turns up every few hundred metres after the first 250 m. Drive or hop into that lane to collect it — a purple flash ring confirms the pickup. You can carry up to 2. You can also start with one: equip <em>Roadster Jump</em> on the track screen (daily check-in day 5, cups and the shop give them).</div><em class="gtap">${X.info} tap for details</em></button>
          <button class="gstep" data-a="gstep"><img src="${By}" alt="" /><b><i>2</i> The ROADSTER button appears</b><small>A purple ROADSTER button shows bottom-right with how many you hold.</small>
            <div class="gmore"><b>Details</b>While you hold a charge, a round purple <em>ROADSTER</em> button sits above the red SOS button (it turns gold for a HYPER JUMP). A normal swipe UP is always just a small hop — only the button fires the rocket, so you never waste it by accident. Keyboard: <em>R</em> or <em>Shift</em>.</div><em class="gtap">${X.info} tap for details</em></button>
          <button class="gstep" data-a="gstep"><img src="${Vy}" alt="" /><b><i>3</i> Tap ROADSTER to launch</b><small>Flies 5.6 m over cars blocking every lane, barrel roll at the top.</small>
            <div class="gmore"><b>Details</b>When a car blockade (a semi truck + cars across all 3 lanes) appears, a toast warns you ~120 m ahead. Tap the button on the road: the car rockets 5.6 m up, clears both rows of cars, rolls 360° and lands safely — you are protected for the whole flight. Pressed in the air? It fires the moment your wheels touch the road. No rocket? Collect one, buy one, or use SOS.</div><em class="gtap">${X.info} tap for details</em></button>
        </div>
        <div class="gmyth">${X.hyper}<div><b>Mythic HYPER JUMP</b><small>Win it in Cups, Day-7 check-in or the Shop: 7.4 m high, double roll, golden trail. Fires from the same button (gold).</small></div></div>
        <button class="btn big" data-a="boosttrain" data-v="super">${X.play} Practice it</button>
      </div>
    </section>

